      "requirementId": "R-flat-face-geometry-and-copy-safety",
      "method": "visual",
      "targetSlots": [
        "ac45-flat-artwork",
        "cb45-flat-artwork",
        "bv45-flat-artwork"
      ],
      "criteria": "Each board must depict two equal upright outside faces side by side, with a separate dimension-guide key and geometry consistent with pouch-geometry.en.md. Check the stated physical dimensions, proportional seal widths, opposed V cuts centred at y = 20 mm, and a tear reference joining them. The notch vertices must correspond to (0,18), (3,20), (0,22) on the left and (140,18), (137,20), (140,22) on the right. The guide must identify the specified safe bounds, and mandatory packaging copy plus its immediate label backgrounds must remain inside them on both faces. Decorative backgrounds may extend through seal bands. Export scale may vary; conflicting dimensions, missing structural features, mirrored backs or unsafe copy fail.",
