      ],
      "criteria": "Require four clearly ordered stages showing a notch-led tear that detaches the upper strip while leaving one continuous lower pouch, the entire dry portion emptied into a bowl, 120 ml hot water added to the bowl followed by stirring, and a 3-minute wait followed by another stir. Read the four numbered sentences and complete caution against COMMON BACK COPY verbatim. Preserve recognisable AC45 artwork wherever the pouch appears. Illustration style and utensils may vary; missing actions, wrong amounts, water added to the pouch, incorrect wording or an inconsistent pouch identity fail.",
